WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:20.600
Rachel: Ricky, where are you going?

2
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.020
Rachel: That's my hat and scarf!

3
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.560
Ricky: I have to go.

4
00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.430
Brian: Great, Ricky! Where did you get those?

5
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.476
Ricky: He-he! They're Rachel's.

6
00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.630
Ricky: The snowman needs to be warm.

7
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:50.320
Brenda: Two raisins for the eyes . . . and a few for the mouth.

8
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.660
Ricky: And a carrot for the nose.

9
00:00:53.661 --> 00:00:57.289
Ricky: Where is the carrot?

10
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
Ricky: I put it right there.

11
00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:05.800
Ricky: Brian? Where are you?

12
00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:17.778
Brian: He-he . . . Sorry guys!

13
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.340
Brian: Carrots are my favorite.

14
00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.920
Ricky: Give me the carrot, Brian.

15
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.740
Brenda: It looks great!

16
00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:37.208
Brian: Ewww! Ricky, what are you eating?

17
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:42.140
Ricky: I'm thirsty. This snow is good.

18
00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.012
Brian: Did you hear that?

19
00:01:53.013 --> 00:01:59.157
Ricky: Hear what? Eat some snow, Brian.

20
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:00.700
Brian: Ouch!

21
00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:06.740
Ricky: It's Spike and Hopper! Everyone, hide.
